====== Actiontec GT701 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The device is based on Texas Instrument AR7. It uses the target ''ar7'' in OpenWrt.
Kamikaze (8.09.2) seems to work (10.03 seems to not work).

