=== Damaged Environment ===
Note the IP address changed to 169.254.87.1. ADAM2 still responds at this address and recovery is possible without connecting to the serial port (opening the product is not required). You will need to quote SETENV a long list of environment variables to fully return the product to normal operating state.
<code>
BUILD_OPS       0x301
bootloaderVersion       3.3.7.15
ProductID       AR7DB
HWRevision      Unknown
SerialNumber    none
IPA             169.254.87.1
MAC_PORT        0
MEMSZ           0x01000000
FLASHSZ         0x00400000
MODETTY0        9600,n,8,1,hw
MODETTY1        9600,n,8,1,hw
CPUFREQ         141312000
MIPSFREQ        141312000
SYSFREQ         70656000
AEIBootVersion  3.0
BOOTCFG         m:f:"mtd1"
PROMPT          (psbl)
</code>

